#created by Duel Circuit - Gumblar Gail (Gouki Knightmares, 2018)
#era 2018
#tier Alley headliner (docs/dev/HEADLINERS-2026-11-01.md)
#about Gouki Suprex brings a second Gouki, the two Link into a Knightmare and search two more, Gouki Re-Match and Malicious bring the bodies back, and four of them make Topologic Gumblar Dragon: from then on, every summon rips cards out of both hands.
#why Topologic Gumblar Dragon, Knightmare Mermaid and Soul Charge are Forbidden today; under the September 2018 list Gumblar and Mermaid were legal at three and Soul Charge at one.
#source Built from Format Library deck 67255 (decks/history/gouki.ydk, YCSNIA18): Elder Entity N'tss and Gem-Knight Seraphinite for Invoked Raidjin and Binary Sorceress, so Instant Fusion has a target
